To: Ulf Hansson <ulf.hansson@linaro.org>, Rob Herring <robh@kernel.org>, 
 Krzysztof Kozlowski <krzk+dt@kernel.org>, 
 Conor Dooley <conor+dt@kernel.org>, Adrian Hunter <adrian.hunter@intel.com>, 
